  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Cut each potato in half.\n• Place potato halves on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Arrange cut-side down.\n• Roast until crisp and tender, 40-45 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65adb486553f74890680db50-b6dd2c45.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Roughly chop tomato.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Drain sweetcorn.\n• Drain and rinse brown lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65adb486553f74890680db50-fae8ab4a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the potatoes have 10 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook lentils, carrot and corn, stirring, until just tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• SPICY! This is a mild spice blend, but use less if you're sensitive to heat! Add Tex-Mex spice blend, tomato paste and garlic and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65adb486553f74890680db50-d207e780.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in vegetable stock powder, the water and brown sugar. Simmer until slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes.\n• Season to taste, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65adb486553f74890680db50-1feef8a5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Just before serving, in a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65adb486553f74890680db50-fb74d0cc.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide jacket potatoes and garden salad between plates.\n• Top potatoes with Mexican lentils, light sour cream and Cheddar cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65adb486553f74890680db50-c670e2f5.jpeg"
    }
  ]
